notes:
Client - The one that initiates the request. For example a browser that requests the webpage.
Request and response - User used a browser (the client) to request a webpage from a serverm which sent the webpage to the client.
Protocol - Defines how a client can communicate with a server. Like which commands the client and server understand.
Port - Used to identify a specific service running on a system.
DNS (Domain name system) - Responsible for resolving hostnames, such as github.com to their respective IP addresses.
IP address (Internet protocol address) - The address of a server.


